    "guide_mistakes_note": "Remediation belongs to the active student. Check the displayed name before starting.",
    "guide_mistakes_title": "4. Mistake bank and remediation",
    "guide_offline_body": "After the first visit completes, the browser keeps the app assets needed for offline use. Student data remains in local storage and is not sent to a server by the app.",
    "guide_offline_note": "Do not close the page during the first visit on a weak connection. A notice appears if offline preparation fails.",
    "guide_offline_title": "9. Offline use and privacy",
